#: title.txt:1
#, max-length:30
msgctxt "title.txt:1"
msgid "Delta Chat"
msgstr "டெல்டா அரட்டை"

#: short_description.txt:1
#, max-length:80
msgctxt "short_description.txt:1"
msgid "Decentralized private messenger with chat-shared tools and games."
msgstr ""
"அரட்டை-பகிரப்பட்ட கருவிகள் மற்றும் கேம்களுடன் பரவலாக்கப்பட்ட தனியார் "
"தூதுவர்."

#: full_description.txt:1
#, max-length:4000
msgctxt "full_description.txt:1"
msgid ""
"Delta Chat is a reliable decentralized instant messenger that is easy and fun to use for friends, family, groups and organizations. Delta Chat is developed by a dedicated FOSS contributor community that jointly releases refinements and new features several times a year, across many stores and platforms world-wide.\n"
"\n"
"Features at a glance:\n"
"\n"
"• Private. Instant on-boarding without a phone number or other private data.\n"
"\n"
"• Friends & Family: Only chat with people you know. Unknown users cannot message or follow you without mutual consent.\n"
"\n"
"• Flexible. Supports multiple chat profiles and is easy to setup on multiple devices.\n"
"\n"
"• Extensible. Add tools like shopping lists, calendars or gaming apps to any chat.\n"
"\n"
"• Reliable. Works under bad and adversarial network conditions.\n"
"\n"
"• Secure. Audited End-to-End encryption safe against network and server attacks.\n"
"\n"
"• Sovereign. Can be run with your own e-mail address or server.\n"
"\n"
"• FOSS. Fully Open Source/Free Software, built on Internet Standards."
